;; The expectations of the WebVTT tests of HTML's track element in
;; web-platform-tests, at commit 38d608e1005d6d7f0fecefb3b7b14109ab3c3b1d,
;; which dev/fetch.sh checks out. They're translated by hand from the
;; JavaScript of
;; html/semantics/embedded-content/media-elements/track/track-element/track-webvtt-*.html,
;; but for the two that test rendering. Under the 3-Clause BSD License of
;; web-platform-tests, which is in LICENSE.md next to this file.
;;
;; Each key names an input in the resources directory of those tests,
;; without its .vtt. Its value is nil when the input must fail to load, and
;; otherwise a map of what the test checks:
;;
;; - :cues, a map for each cue that the file must parse into, of the
;;   VTTCue attributes that the test checks, as VTTCue has them
;; - :count, the number of cues alone
;; - :fragments, the DOM of each cue's getCueAsHTML, as HTML Hiccup with
;;   :class, :title and :lang attributes
;; - :text-content, the textContent of each cue's getCueAsHTML
{:commit "38d608e1005d6d7f0fecefb3b7b14109ab3c3b1d"

